    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Quain are delighted to present this detached bungalow on a spacious elevated site c .0.6 Acre. The property has been extended considerably over the years and offers c.132sq.m of living accommodation.Accommodation briefly comprises; entrance porch, living room, kitchen/dining room, 4 bedrooms, two bathrooms and a spacious utility. The property comes with double glazed windows and oil heating. The property is accessed via a long driveway and there are very generous lawned areas to the front and rear.The property is centrally located in Coosan, in close proximity to Coosan National School, Coosan Point and short Drive from Athlone town centre and all its amenities.VIEWING STRICTY BY APPOINTMENT:SHERRY FITZGERALD QUAINAGENT: LIAM QUAIN"
      },
